  "limitations": [
    "The deployment proves the release image, schema migrations, empty append-only tables, health, and unauthenticated refusal boundary; it does not prove an authenticated live request or quote flow.",
    "The verified-quote repository is not exposed by an API route and has no job-creation, wallet, funding, notification, settlement, or chain-write connection.",
